it in my pack for a full day of hiking upriver. </p><br><p>Fast forward a few years in San Francisco, and I faced a similar challenge. Whether biking or Ubering to the beach, traditional coolers were just too bulky to be practical on-the-go.</p><br><p>After hundreds of prototypes, I’m now a dad in Charleston, SC, juggling baby gear and two golden retrievers, always needing the most hassle-free gear I can get. </p><br><p>Our flagship coolers fold down small enough to fit in your back, purse, or carry-on without sacrificing functionality. We’re building a lifestyle brand for cities, marshes, mountains, and everything in between.</p><p>Building this brand has been an incredible journey, and I’d love for you to join us.<br><br>-Sam, Founder</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="302a30c9-b8f6-40fe-a7c4-5aa870dd0c43" class="r-1x2k4sr"><div data-replo-marquee-root="true" data-rid="3a2edc14-6b91-4a7c-ac8e-ec3a15480117" class="r-y8i6vm"><div class="r-13qav89" data-replo-marquee-track="true"><div data-rid="b9015673-0471-4ff5-81f7-e6bd0d8b9091" class="r-1lrbboz"><div data-rid="6e5e0328-b873-4138-80a0-61028af403e5" class="r-pt5bfo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Marshes</p></span></div><picture data-rid="8114a6ba-752f-4be3-911e-90ae7194647d" class="r-wck287"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/8c041c80-ce72-4379-9917-0587b3742c87?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/8c041c80-ce72-4379-9917-0587b3742c87?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/8c041c80-ce72-4379-9917-0587b3742c87?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/8c041c80-ce72-4379-9917-0587b3742c87" alt="Red text spelling &#x27;MONTI&#x27; on a white ba